@@ -1,3 +1,19 @@
 # app
 
 The example.com/app backend.
+
+## Docker
+
+Build the image from the repository root:
+
+```sh
+docker build -t app .
+```
+
+Run it and publish port 8080:
+
+```sh
+docker run --rm -p 8080:8080 app
+```
+
+The server listens on port 8080. Check it with `curl http://localhost:8080/healthz`.
